<%- contentFor('body') %>

<main class="policy-page">
    <div class="policy-container">
        <header class="policy-header">
            <span class="policy-badge">Razorpay Compliant</span>
            <h1>Refund & Cancellation Policy</h1>
            <p class="policy-updated">Last Updated: November 2026</p>
        </header>

        <article class="policy-body">
            <p>At <strong>ROINAX Global</strong>, we prioritize fair and clear return policies for all CSP hardware, accessories, and digital registration services.</p>

            <h2>1. Order Cancellation Policy</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Before Courier Dispatch:</strong> You may cancel a physical hardware order within <strong>6 hours</strong> of payment confirmation or before the courier shipping label is generated by emailing <code>roinaxglobal@gmail.com</code>. In such cases, 100% of the paid order amount will be refunded.</li>
                <li><strong>After Dispatch:</strong> Once physical parcels are handed over to the courier network, cancellation is not possible until delivery is completed and inspection terms are met.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>2. Defective / Dead on Arrival (DOA) Hardware</h2>
            <p>If your biometric scanner, thermal printer, or MicroATM arrives damaged in transit or non-functional out of the box:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Notify us within <strong>48 hours</strong> of receiving the package with photographic and unboxing video evidence.</li>
                <li>Send details with your Order Reference and Razorpay Payment ID to <code>roinaxglobal@gmail.com</code>.</li>
                <li>Upon verification, we will arrange a reverse pickup or authorize a replacement unit at zero additional cost.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>3. Non-Refundable / Exempt Products</h2>
            <div class="policy-callout">
                Certain products are irreversible and strictly non-refundable:
                <ul style="margin: 8px 0 0 16px;">
                    <li><strong>Annual RD Service Licenses:</strong> Digital device whitelisting tokens generated with device serial numbers on UIDAI portals cannot be recalled or reused.</li>
                    <li><strong>Customized Branch Seals & Flex Boards:</strong> Pre-inked stamps and signage personalized with your specific CSP kiosk code or name.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <h2>4. Refund Settlement Timelines</h2>
            <p>Once an eligible return is received at our facility and verified for intact accessories, cables, and packaging:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Approved refunds are triggered automatically via our <strong>Razorpay Merchant Dashboard</strong> to the original payment source (UPI, Debit Card, Credit Card, or Netbanking).</li>
                <li>Under RBI and banking gateway settlement standards, the refunded amount reflects in the customer's bank account within <strong>5 to 7 business days</strong>.</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="contact-card">
                <strong>Refund Help Desk:</strong><br>
                Email: <code>roinaxglobal@gmail.com</code><br>
                Phone: +91 7318692999
            </div>
        </article>
    </div>
</main>